    {
      "annotations": {
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": false,
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "title": "boot"
      },
      "description": "Boot and wait until finished (iOS: env is the device launchd's environment, shaped injects the network shaper; settle also waits up to settle_timeout_s (600) until the device's processes use under settle_cpu_pct (10) % of a core for settle_window_s (10) s (settle_foreground, the default: counting only foreground-QoS CPU) and returns the timings with cpu_pct, foreground_cpu_pct, background_cpu_pct and cpu_s (CPU-seconds the tree used since the boot; for a device already booted, since the first sample), settled false if it ran out of time; profile turns off a named set of daemons (written before the boot of a shut-down device, so they never start); Android: starts emu and waits for sys.boot_completed, silent unless audio, which plays the device on the host's default output; camera_back and camera_front link a camera source first, as camera_link does, saved for later boots too). Returns `admission`, what the device would do to the host (as `admission_check`; nothing for one already booted): admission ignore, the default, only reports it; refuse fails fast unless the verdict is admit; wait waits until it is (at most admission_timeout_s, 600) and returns `pacing`. Acts on the device each time it is called. Can take a while (seconds to minutes): a client with the tasks extension gets a task to poll.\n\nPlatforms: Android, iOS. Parameters: device, timeout_s?, admission?(ignore|refuse|wait), admission_timeout_s?; iOS: env?, shaped?, settle?, settle_cpu_pct?, settle_window_s?, settle_foreground?(true), settle_timeout_s?, profile?(\"slim\"); Android: audio?(false), camera_back?, camera_front?. Toolsets: core, lifecycle.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "admission": {
            "enum": [
              "ignore",
              "refuse",
              "wait"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "admission_timeout_s": {
            "description": "seconds",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "audio": {
            "default": false,
            "description": "Android only",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "camera_back": {
            "description": "Android only",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "camera_front": {
            "description": "Android only",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device": {
            "description": "A device's UDID, name or `booted`",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "env": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "iOS only",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "profile": {
            "description": "iOS only",
            "enum": [
              "slim"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "settle": {
            "description": "iOS only",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "settle_cpu_pct": {
            "description": "iOS only; percent of one core",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "settle_foreground": {
            "default": true,
            "description": "iOS only",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "settle_timeout_s": {
            "description": "iOS only; seconds",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "settle_window_s": {
            "description": "iOS only; seconds",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "shaped": {
            "description": "iOS only",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "timeout_s": {
            "description": "seconds",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "name": "boot",
      "outputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "admission": {
            "properties": {
              "predicted": {
                "properties": {
                  "admissible": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "boot_cpu_pct": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "boot_memory_bytes": {
