    {
      "annotations": {
        "openWorldHint": false,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "title": "logs"
      },
      "description": "Unified log lines (default last 1m), as `log show --style compact` prints them. stream: the first call starts one in-device `log stream` for the device's boot, and later calls answer the window from it without spawning (log show answers a window reaching back before the stream started, a predicate, and a `last` other than <n>s|m|h|d); the stream stops after 5 idle minutes or a reboot. It omits launchd_sim's lines, signpost state dumps and `Last log repeated` lines (iOS 27.2: 12% of a settled device's lines, 1% of a just-booted one's), and its timestamps are often 1 ms later. Read-only: changes nothing on the device or the host. A long list pages: give `limit` (at most 1000) and pass back `next_cursor` as `cursor` for the next page; without either, the whole list.\n\nPlatforms: iOS. Parameters: device, last?, predicate?, stream?(false). Toolsets: core, observe.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "cursor": {
            "description": "A previous page's `next_cursor`: the page after it, of the same list (kept 10 minutes)",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device": {
            "description": "A device's UDID, name or `booted`",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "last": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "limit": {
            "description": "At most this many items; the result is a page with `next_cursor` (null on the last page) and `total`",
            "maximum": 1000,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "predicate": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "stream": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "name": "logs",
      "outputSchema": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "properties": {
              "items": {
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "type": "array"
